ZAINAB SE KAHA SHEH NE ALAM KHAIME MEIN LAKAR MAIN HOGAYA TANHA<br>
 MARAGAYE DARYA PA ALAMDAR BARADAR MAIN HOGAYA TAHNA<br>
<br>
DARYA PA KAATE MERE ALAMDAR KE SHAANE JAB AHLE JAFA NE,<br>
 HAMLA KIYA PICCHE SE MERE BHAI PA CHUP KAR MAIN HOGAYA TANHA<br>
<br>
GHERE HUE HAIN CHARO TARAF SE SITAM EJAAD TAYYAR HAIN JALLAD,<br>
 GARDANPA CHALEGA MERI AB SHUMR KA KHANJAR MAIN HOGAYA TANHA<br>
<br>
SAR KAAT KE NAIZE PA CHADHEYENGE AB ADA YE ZULM BHI HOGA,<br>
 AB KOUN BACHAYEGA MUJHE AAYE MERI QAHAR MAIN HOGAYA TAHNA<br>
<br>
AKBAR HAI QASIM HAI NA HAI OUN MOHAMMED HAI ZULM KI YE HADD,<br>
 SAAB LUT GAYA KARBAL MEIN MERA HAYE BHARA GHAR MAIN HOGAYA TANHA<br>
<br>
DIL ZAKHMI NAZAR ZAKHMI KAMAR TUTI HUI HAI AFAAT KI GHADI HAI,<br>
 ROTA HOON BHAI KOTOHHASTEY HAIN SITAMGAR MAIN HOGAYA TANHA<br>
<br>
AB KOI BHI JINE KI MUJHE AAS NAHIN HAI ABBAS NAHIN HAI,<br>
 BIN BHAI KE IS DASHT MEIN ZINDA RAHOO KYON KAR MAIN HOGAYA TANHA<br>
<br>
KHAIMO KO JALAYENGE SARE SHAAM YE AZLAM IS BAAT KA HAI GHAM,<br>
 CHEEN JAYEGI ZAINAB TERE SAR SE TERI CHADAR MAIN HOGAYA TANHA<br>
<br>
YE NOUHA HAMEED AUR HASAN KA JO NAYA HAI AWAAZE AZAA HAI,<br>
 HAIN BAIN MERE HAAL PA DONO KI ZUBAAN PAR MAIN HOGAYA TANHA..